     <section class="screen panel" data-screen="howto" hidden>
       <header class="sheet-head"><button class="back" data-focus data-go="back" aria-label="Back">‹</button><h2>How to play</h2></header>
       <div class="sheet-body"><div class="how"><table class="controls">${Os.map(([e,t])=>`<tr><td>${e}</td><td>${Yt(t)}</td></tr>`).join(``)}</table>
       <div class="modes"><p><b>Race:</b> the Lagos Night Run against Tanker and Wire. Knock them into the barrier, smash crates, don't rear-end a danfo. First across the line wins.</p>
       <p><b>Story:</b> the Road to King of Eko. Five chapters, each with its own road and goal. Clear them to earn oriki, praise names the griot sings at the start line, printed on your WANTED poster (Legend).</p>
       <p><b>The System:</b> every race gives XP. Level up from Rank E to S and spend stat points (Status). A new daily quest waits each day; keep your streak.</p>
       <p><b>Kokoro Rush:</b> riding with style fills RUSH. Unleash it: a speed surge, untouchable, and a shockwave that throws rivals aside.</p>
       <p><b>Ramps and Gala:</b> hit a ramp (planks on drums) fast and fly over traffic; a long one is BIG AIR. Grab a Gala roll and the next crash or hit just bounces off.</p>
       <p><b>Eko Postcards:</b> ride past the National Theatre, NECOM House, Tafawa Balewa Square, the Eyo and the Cathedral to collect their postcards (Legend).</p>
       <p><b>Agbero Ambush:</b> three waves of touts want your "dues". K.O. them all before three laps run out. Rivals you beat in the Story join your crew and fight beside you.</p>
       <p><b>Flow:</b> ride a whole line of cowries and Sade pulls a stunt: WHEELIE, then STAND-UP, then KOKORO SPIN if you chain lines. Stunts score, refill boost and drop ⚙ parts.</p>
       <p><b>Yaba Base:</b> build with ◎ and ⚙. A coin magnet, a Zobo stand that pre-charges Rush, a Suya spot, a mechanic, and a billboard that earns while you're away.</p>
       <p><b>Grab:</b> gold cowries (money for the Garage), Zobo (refills boost), Suya (heals). Near misses past danfos, hits, overtakes and clean laps build your combo up to ×5. A crash breaks it.</p>
       <p><b>Missions:</b> three at a time on the home screen. Finish them for ◎; spend ◎ on paint in the Garage.</p>
       <p><b>Time Trial:</b> just you and the ghost of your best run. The split under the clock says if you're ahead.</p>
       <p><b>Rainy season:</b> some nights it pours (Settings → Weather). The road gets slick: brake earlier, turn wider.</p></div></div></div>
     </section>

